      "description": "Your new home for FC Ultimate Team.\n\nCleaner. Faster. Uninterrupted. The FUT.GG app is the quickest way to browse the FUT database. \n\nEVOLUTIONS: the most complete Evo experience. FUT.GG shows you every possible Evo combination to find your next club legend. \n\nPRICES: instant Transfer Market prices and trends at your fingertips.\n\nHOME FEED: uniquely-designed to show you the latest content added to the game. Never miss new players, promos, Evos, SBCs, or Objectives. \n\nCLUB PAST & PRESENT: see all past and present content related to your favourite club. \n\nSQUAD BUILDER: build the future of your Ultimate Team and find new suggested players. \n\nSBCs: our AI algorithm finds you the quickest and cheapest solutions for new SBCs.\n \nOBJECTIVES: stay up-to-date with the latest objectives to grind XP. \n\nWATCHLIST: track and quickly access players you're interested in.\n\nTo give us feedback feel free to contact us on X (@FUTxGG) or Instagram (@futggsite). \n\nYou can also talk directly to our developers in our Discord, head to: fut.gg/discord\n\n\nPrivacy Policy:\nhttps://www.fut.gg/privacy/\n\nTerms of Service:\nhttps://www.fut.gg/terms/\n\nThis app was created under license from Electronic Arts Inc. Trademarks are property of their respective owners. Game materials copyright Electronic Arts Inc. and/or its licensors. Electronic Arts Inc. and its licensors have not endorsed and are not responsible for the operations of or content on this app.",
